@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.TeamFarisModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Faris Ristiansyah";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Our Team</p>
                <h2>Faris Ristiansyah</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A generalist whose journey began as a job,
                    but gradually became a deeper process of learning,
                    understanding, and growing alongside others.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Generalist</span>
                    <span>Learning</span>
                    <span>Growth</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="team-profile-hero-img reveal">
                <img src="/images/team/faris.jpg" alt="Faris Ristiansyah">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">His Beginning</p>
                <h3>From Work to Something More</h3>

                <p>
                    Faris’s journey at Kopi Cinta started as a job.
                </p>

                <p>
                    But over time, it became something more meaningful—
                    a process of learning, understanding, and growing.
                </p>

                <p>
                    In the team, he takes on a generalist role,
                    handling different responsibilities and adapting
                    to various situations.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>His Role</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Generalist</li>
                    <li>Multi-role support</li>
                    <li>Adaptable collaboration</li>
                    <li>Operational flexibility</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Experience</p>
                <h3>Learning Alongside Deaf Friends</h3>

                <p>
                    One of the most memorable parts of his journey
                    is working alongside Deaf friends.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Not just collaborating,
                    but also learning sign language—
                    an experience that stays with him
                    and becomes part of who he is.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Growth</p>
                <h3>Small Moments, Real Learning</h3>

                <p>
                    Through daily work, Faris realized that even the smallest things
                    always carry opportunities to grow.
                </p>

                <p>
                    What started as work slowly turned into genuine curiosity—
                    to understand more, to be more involved,
                    and to grow with the journey itself.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>His Reflection</h3>

            <p>
                Through his experience, Faris hopes what they do at Kopi Cinta
                can reach more people and open spaces for understanding without limits.
            </p>

            <p>
                Because for him, understanding doesn’t always start from something big—
                it starts with the willingness to learn.
            </p>
        </div>

        <br />

        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Team</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>